# Training example format for instruct-tuning
Instruction: {{instruction}}
Response (annotated with parallelization control tokens where the model identifies independent sub-branches):
{{main_response_prefix}}
[FORK] {{parallel_branch_1}} [FORK] {{parallel_branch_2}} [JOIN]
{{main_response_suffix}}

# At inference, the fine-tuned model emits [FORK]/[JOIN] tokens itself, and the serving system spawns/merges generation threads accordingly — no separate skeleton-generation prompt call is needed.
